<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/industrial-iot">Industrial &amp; IoT</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">PCBA &amp; Box Build</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Industrial &amp; IoT products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s active" href="/markets/industrial-iot/pcba-box-build"><span class="abbr">PB</span><span class="label">PCBA &amp; Box Build</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/industrial-iot/iot-device-assembly"><span class="abbr">ID</span><span class="label">IoT Device Assembly</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/industrial-iot/rfid-asset-tracking"><span class="abbr">RT</span><span class="label">RFID Asset Tracking</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/industrial-iot/power-modules"><span class="abbr">PM</span><span class="label">Power Modules</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the product does and where it runs and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Industrial &amp; IoT &middot; PCBA &amp; Box Build</div><h1 class="mk-h1">PCBA and box build for industrial equipment</h1><p class="mk-lede">Industrial boards run in cabinets, on plant floors and inside outdoor enclosures, where heat, vibration, moisture and airborne contamination are constant rather than occasional conditions. Hana assembles to that environment: conformal and parylene coating, mixed-technology assembly that combines surface-mount with through-hole where a joint has to carry current or take mechanical load, selective and wave soldering, and inspection on every board.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-pcba-box-build" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ PCBA &amp; Box Build &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-pcba-box-build" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Industrial also covers a wider span than plant equipment alone — the same lines build the dense, high density PCBAs that go into infrastructure and data-center hardware. Both have run on our floors for years, alongside our automotive and medical work.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Ruggedized PCBAs</span></div><div class="desc">surface-mount and mixed-technology boards with conformal or parylene coating, through-hole for high-current and heavy connectors, and selective or wave soldering to suit the joint.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Complete box-build units</span></div><div class="desc">the board integrated with its enclosure, wiring and mechanical parts, assembled and functionally tested as one finished product.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">High density PCBA</span></div><div class="desc">dense, multi-layer boards for infrastructure and data-center equipment, built on the same fine-pitch SMT lines with X-ray on the joints a dense layout hides.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">Process depth sits on the capability pages: PCBA &amp; Box Build owns surface-mount through to full product build, and SMT Assembly owns the fine-pitch and high-density detail together with the full inspection and test envelope.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build">Explore PCBA &amp; Box Build <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build/smt-assembly">Explore SMT Assembly <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:820px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Coating, joints and inspection</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">The failure modes in a high-stress environment are well understood — moisture tracking across a board, a solder joint fatigued by vibration, a heavy connector working loose under load. Hana answers each of them with process rather than assumption. Coating is applied and verified for coverage. Through-hole is specified where a joint carries current or takes mechanical strain, with the soldering method matched to it. Automated optical inspection and X-ray check the joints that cannot be seen by eye, and in-circuit and functional test confirm the assembly before it leaves the line. Where a program runs over several years, change control and obsolescence management keep the build consistent as components move through their own life cycles.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><div class="note">industrial PCBA and box build</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">industrial PCBA, conformal and parylene coating</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What industrial products can Hana build?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Control boards and the equipment built around them — industrial controllers, meters, monitors and connected equipment — supplied as bare PCBAs or as complete, tested units.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana build the complete unit, not just the board?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Box build covers the enclosure, wiring and mechanical assembly around the board, functionally tested as one finished product before it ships.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What protection can Hana apply for harsh environments?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Conformal and parylene coating, mixed-technology assembly with through-hole where joints take current or mechanical load, and inspection and functional test coverage. The finish and test set are selected per program and confirmed per site.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana build high density PCBAs for infrastructure and data-center equipment?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Industrial covers a wide span, from ruggedized plant equipment to the dense, multi-layer boards inside infrastructure and data-center hardware. Both run on the same fine-pitch SMT lines, with X-ray inspection on the joints a dense layout hides. For AI-infrastructure work specifically, see our <a href="/markets/data-centers">Data Centers</a> market.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/industrial-iot" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Industrial &amp; IoT market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your industrial build program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>
